+
+## Public boards
+
+Boards can be published so that anyone with the secret public URL can view
+them without signing in. The board JSON includes a `public_url` attribute,
+which is `null` until the board is published.
+
+- `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication` (board admins only) publishes the board.
+- `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication` (board admins only) unpublishes the board.
+
+Published boards are visible at `/:account_slug/public/boards/:key`. Individual
+columns and published cards are also directly viewable at
+`/:account_slug/public/boards/:key/columns/:id` and
+`/:account_slug/public/boards/:key/cards/:number`.
